9:  /** The largest due a clerk may settle, two decimals; null when there is no limit. */
11:  /** The least a claim's live due can be, two decimals. */
13:  /** The number of days after a claim's date it is due by. */
15:  /** The percent of its figure an overdue claim's due gains for every full 30 days, two decimals. */
17:  /** The policy date (YYYY-MM-DD); null when it is the sheet's today. */
19:  /** The period numbering from-date (YYYY-MM-DD); null when off. */
